AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0000016> "A lateral root primordium may arise from cells of a pericycle (PO:0006203) in a root, as in most seed plants (pericyclic lateral root primordium; PO:0025492), or from cells of an endodermis (PO:0000252) or other tissue in ferns and some seed plants (non-pericyclic lateral root primordium: PO:0025493). Transition from lateral root primordium to lateral root occurs with the formation of a root cap (PO:0020123), shortly after the development of a root apical meristem (PO:0020147), which can occur before the lateral root penetrates the exterior of the parent root.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0000016> "lateral root primordium")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0000016> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0005029>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0000016> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0009005>))

