AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0007601> "During this stage, the process of floral meristem growth (GO:0010451) occurs. This process is defined as the increase in size or mass of a floral meristem, a population of undifferentiated cells in a plant that gives rise to a flower.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0007601> "floral organ meristem development stage")
