AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "POC:curators") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0009008> "A multi-tissue plant structure (PO:0025496) that is a functional unit, is a proper part of a whole plant (PO:0000003), and includes portions of plant tissue (PO:0009007) of at least two different types that derive from a common developmental path.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasBroadSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0009008> "organ (broad)")
