AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "POC:curators") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0020039> "A phyllome lamina (PO:0025396) that is the part of a leaf (PO:0025034) exclusive of the petiole (PO:0020038) or leaf sheath (PO:0020104), if either is present.")
