AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0030027> "A thallus is a gametophyte of liverworts and pteridophytes and develops from a short-lived protonema. Roughly two dimensional growth results from division of a single apical cell. Thalli may be ribbon or heart shaped or almost filamentous. Although there are no distinct organs, there may be tissue differentiation and dichotomous branching.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0030027> "thallus")
