AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0030056> "May also give rise to sterile cells such as elators (in liverworts) or tapetal cells. In most species outside seed plants, multiple archesporial cells are part of an archesporium or sporogenous tissue.")
