AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PO_0030083> "In Physcomitrella patens, a gametophore bud initial typically is more bulbous than a protonema side branch initial, and its plane of first cell division is oblique, rather than perpendicular, to the plane of growth.")
